{"kind": "mod", "id": 898, "name": "Kmy Tarkov Api", "slug": "kmy-tarkov-api", "teaser": "Api Framework for Client Mods", "owner_name": "kmyuhkyuk", "downloads": 394726, "favourites": 172, "featured": false, "contains_ads": true, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": "com.kmyuhkyuk.kmytarkovapi", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T06:14:13.000000Z", "created_at": "2023-05-29T12:11:15.000000Z", "published_at": "2023-05-29T12:11:15.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "4.0.x", "latest_version": "1.5.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Api</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>This framework provides Modder with Api interface compatible multiple Tarkov game versions</p>\n<p>(3.11.0 +)</p>\n<p>Reference KmyTarkovApi.dll Quick access eft instance by EFTGlobal or Register Hook by EFTHelpers</p>\n<p>Currently Api is Experimental, If it cause issue or your want merge Feature, Submit Issues to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/kmyuhkyuk/KmyTarkovApi/issues\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here</a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Reflection</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Get Access Delegate of Method Field Property from RefHelper</p>\n<p>Quickly Get Type or MethodInfo from RefTool</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">ConfigurationManager</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>A new Configuration Manager, Home Key Open</p>\n<p>It will get mod icon, download count, download link and check mod version from Aki Hub mod web page.</p>\n<p>And it supports localization setting name</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Install</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Extract BepInEx folder from 7z to Game Root directory</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Support Me</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Make and Update Mods spends a lot of my free time</p>\n<p>You can support me on one of website below that way I can motivated continue to do modding work</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://afdian.net/a/kmyuhkyuk\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AfDian</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.buymeacoffee.com/kmyuhkyuk\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">BuymeaCoffee</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://patreon.com/kmyuhkyuk\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Patreon</a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-6\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Repost</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Please do not repost on other websites without my consent</p>\n<p>This mod only released on</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://sns.oddba.cn/75284.html\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Oddba</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1215-eft-api\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SPT</a></p></div></div></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.2.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 44694, "published_at": "2024-04-05T02:21:45.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/898/kmy-tarkov-api/1.2.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.2.2", "spt_version_constraint": "3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 65802, "published_at": "2024-07-07T12:28:29.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/898/kmy-tarkov-api/1.2.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependen